@host=http://localhost:2000
###
GET {{host}}/urns/urn:raw:lorawan:data:67a9db400696ac3cf49b07c0
### Object as rawdata
GET {{host}}/urns/urn:raw:a22:environment:6891e54b9237c6dd3479712f
### Huge json as string
GET {{host}}/urns/urn:raw:s3-poller:meteorology-bz-forecast:67a4ce70d3a62887e54455e2
### Has an array as rawdata
GET {{host}}/urns/urn:raw:parking-offstreet-famas:bolzano:683ff7249237c6dd345cbf29

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- compacted
### The current value of every key. A consumer walks every page of this at
### startup, and walks it again to reconcile — that is the whole protocol.
GET {{host}}/enrichment/parking/compacted/key

### Paging: `next` from the previous response goes back in as `cursor`, exactly
### as it came out. It is opaque; do not build one.
GET {{host}}/enrichment/parking/compacted/key?limit=500&cursor=GwAAAAJmAAQAAABrZXkAAnYABAAAAEIwMQAA

### A different meta field to group on
GET {{host}}/enrichment/parking/compacted/station_code

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- documents
### The last document written to a collection.
GET {{host}}/enrichment/parking/documents?limit=1

### The recent tail. Every revision, nothing collapsed, newest *written* first —
### a backfill leads this list while carrying an old timestamp.
GET {{host}}/enrichment/parking/documents?limit=20

### Continue: `next` is the previous page's cursor, handed back unchanged.
GET {{host}}/enrichment/parking/documents?limit=20&cursor=JgAAAAJmAAsAAAAkZG9jdW1lbnRzAAd2AGg_9ySSN8bdNFy_KQA

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- refusals
### 400 - limit must be between 1 and 10000
GET {{host}}/enrichment/parking/compacted/key?limit=0

### 400 - nested keys are not supported; the field is one level under meta
GET {{host}}/enrichment/parking/compacted/meta.key

### 400 - operators are not identifiers
GET {{host}}/enrichment/parking/compacted/$where

### 400 - a cursor this endpoint did not issue
GET {{host}}/enrichment/parking/documents?cursor=not-an-object-id

### 400 - a bare object id is not a cursor; hand back `next` verbatim
GET {{host}}/enrichment/parking/documents?cursor=683ff7249237c6dd345cbf29

### 400 - '.' is legal in a collection name, never in a database name
GET {{host}}/enrichment.parking/x/documents

### 404 - no such collection (as opposed to an empty one, which is 200)
GET {{host}}/enrichment/typo_in_the_values_file/compacted/key
